    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Occasional mild burning before breakfast; no black stools or vomiting</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild low back stiffness; thumb ache after gripping</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No leg pain, numbness or weakness; no headache or memory trouble</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>3 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

