    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 1956-09-29; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Well; blood pressure 124/78 mmHg, pulse 58; weight 89.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Abdomen</td><td>Soft; no epigastric tenderness</td></tr><tr><td>Back</td><td>Minimal paraspinal tenderness; forward bending to mid-shin without leg pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Straight-leg raise negative on both sides; strength, reflexes and sensation normal in the legs</td></tr><tr><td>Left hand</td><td>Mild tenderness at the base of the thumb; grind test mildly positive</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

